  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "dhivehi-audios-82-spk",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDhivehi Synthetic Voice and Speech Augmentation Dataset\n\t\n\nThis dataset is a multi-speaker dataset containing 1.26 million synthetic audio samples (~2,627 hours total). Each sample pairs a Dhivehi sentence with an augmented waveform, created through controlled synthesis, voice-cloning, and heavy acoustic perturbations. The dataset was generated to enable ASR, TTS, and voice-representation research in low-resource Dhivehi, focusing on robustness across pronunciation, prosody, and timbre\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/alakxender/dhivehi-audios-82-spk.",
  "alternateName": [
    "alakxender/dhivehi-audios-82-spk",
    "dv_syn_audios"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "rusputin",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/alakxender"
  },
  "keywords": [
